<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in light trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 580.41, up 0.42.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 270 to 228.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.01.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 14,822,160 compared with 18,233,980 on Thursday.</p>
<p>	   (Prices official as of 1645 EDT/2045 GMT)</p>
</text>
